# Aside

While [The Raiders of Cho-la-gi](/posts/2021/06/06/a1006) required most of my effort just to understand its very complex cases, this problem's cases weren't so much complex as they were time-consuming to understand and apply network flow to. Looking at the problem list, there seems to be a stretch where platinum-rated problems keep appearing one after another, so I'm starting to seriously wonder whether solving them in order is really the right approach.

